  "title": "Individual Air Fryer Pear-Pomegranate Crisps",
  "description": "Use your air fryer to whip up these individual crisps with pear and pomegranate seeds in 30 minutes. Garnish with whipped cream for additional flair, if you wish!",
  "authors": [
    "Bibi"
  ],
  "date_published": "2021-12-06T01:12:25-05:00",
